      ],
      "inputs": ["saleOrderId:Ref!", "recoveryId:Ref!", "双方expectedVersion:int!", "amountCents:cents!"],
      "result": "原子折抵双方余额并生成唯一凭据；折抵为非现金事件，同时作用双方余额。",
      "effects": ["Offset", "SaleOrder", "Recovery", "CashEntry"],
      "errors": ["OFFSET_EXCEEDED", "VERSION_CONFLICT", "OWNERSHIP_INVALID", "PERMISSION_DENIED"],
      "uiRefs": ["置换"],
      "notes": [
        "路径与权限分离：建立关联归 tradein/create，应用折抵归 tradein/offset（老板专属，03 §8「确认折抵」）。",
        "最终价未定不能结算（02 §5 置换行）。"
      ]
    },
    {
