      "name": "取消采购",
      "domain": "inventory",
      "entity": "Purchase",
      "stateMachine": null,
      "status": "frozen",
      "operations": [{ "method": "POST", "path": "/inventory/purchases/:id/cancel", "permission": "inventory/purchase-cancel" }],
      "inputs": ["lines:PurchaseCancelLine[]!", "reason:PurchaseCancelReason!", "note:string?", "occurredAt:timestamp?"],
      "result": "按采购行取消尚未到货的数量；不改写订购量，不取消已到货或已拒收数量。",
      "effects": ["Purchase"],
      "errors": ["PURCHASE_CANCEL_EXCEEDED", "PURCHASE_PAYMENT_CONFLICT", "VERSION_CONFLICT", "IDEMPOTENCY_MISMATCH", "ENTITY_NOT_FOUND", "VALIDATION_ERROR", "PERMISSION_DENIED"],
      "uiRefs": ["缺件处理"],
      "notes": [
        "部分取消必须逐采购行给出数量；采购恒等式为 ordered = received + rejected + cancelled + pending。",
        "已到货数量即使后来通过 B38 退供，也仍属于已处置数量，不能用 B37 再取消。",
        "本首版不把采购付款自动退款并入取消动作；存在净付款时返回 PURCHASE_PAYMENT_CONFLICT，先处理付款冲销。",
        "B33 付款应付基数按未取消数量计算，不能为已取消数量付款。"
      ]
    },
