      "code": "B38",
      "name": "退供",
      "domain": "inventory",
      "entity": "StockItem",
      "stateMachine": null,
      "status": "frozen",
      "operations": [{ "method": "POST", "path": "/inventory/supplier-returns", "permission": "inventory/supplier-return" }],
      "inputs": ["purchaseId:Ref?", "stockItemId:StockItemRef?", "productRef:Ref!", "qty:int!", "condition:StockCondition?", "reason:string!", "supplierName:string?", "occurredAt:timestamp?"],
      "result": "自有在库或待处理件减少并留下退供来源事件；不增加可用量，也不冒充采购到货。",
      "effects": ["StockItem", "StockBalance", "InventoryMovement", "Receipt"],
      "errors": ["OWNERSHIP_INVALID", "VERSION_CONFLICT", "VALIDATION_ERROR", "PERMISSION_DENIED"],
      "uiRefs": ["缺件处理", "库存"],
      "notes": [
        "2026-09-21 E07 契约修订：由 supplementaryActions 的 reserved 提升为正式动作（enums.json ActionCode 同步补入 B38）。路径与权限沿用旧登记值，未另起新名。",
        "对应 enums.json inventoryBucketRules 的两条：quarantine → retired（拒收退供）与 available → retired（已入库件退货供）。两条都不增加可用量。",
        "退供是自有在库减少，必须带原因、责任与来源事件（03 §7）；不得用 B15 入库伪造差异，也不得退成 quarantine 再当可卖。",
        "拒收发生在 B15 实到验收时（inspectionDisposition=return_to_supplier），此时实物从未进入自有在库；本动作处理的是已经进过账、事后决定退给供应商的部分。两者不互相替代。"
      ]
    },
